  "text": {
    "formatted": "- A Grappled creature's speed becomes 0, and it can't benefit from any bonus to its speed.\n- The condition ends if the grappler is Incapacitated (see the condition).\n- The condition also ends if an effect removes the Grappled creature from the reach of the grappler or grappling effect, such as when a creature is hurled away by the _thunderwave_ spell.",
